@kind(writ)

#[ Writ: pure-forbidden fixture ]

##[ parser-purity ]

@rule(parser-purity){
  guard: { twrit: pure }

  pure: {
    crates: [ "core" ]
    forbid: [ "std::fs" ]
    allow-external: [ ]
  }
}

The other half of the rule: an allowlist stops the ability arriving as a
dependency, and this stops it being done bare-handed.
